#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:83
msgid "Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim rather than paraphrased."
